<title>CANADA: Canadian bond market to close at noon on Monday.</title>
<headline>Canadian bond market to close at noon on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Toronto bond market will close early at 1200 EDT/1600 GMT on Monday ahead of the Canada Day holiday, the Toronto Bond Traders' Association said.</p>
<p>The move essentially means an early close for the entire Canadian bond market because most trading is done in Toronto.</p>
<p>Canadian stock and bond markets will be closed on Tuesday for Canada Day.</p>
<p>((Jeffrey Hodgson (416) 941-8105, e-mail: jeffrey.hodgson@reuters.com))</p>
